{
  "app_id": 2450350,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Welcome to Fat Goblins , where chaos, chubbiness, and class based combat come together in the form of 16v16 giant castle battles! Prepare for goblin-packed, hat-stealing, and princess-fattening team-based combat with up to 32 players total! Don different hats to launch fireballs, heal teammates, shoot arrows, or just slice your way through the enemy team! Breach the walls and rescue your pudgy princess from the clutches of the enemy castle! Fatten up the enemy princess your team holds captive with delicious meat scavenged from fallen teammates & enemies! Play games to upgrade your runes and unlock new hats and classes! Combine abilities with teammates to create powerful combinations!"
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
